# "Unless you control a Swamp or a Mountain" asks for the land types, not the names: Underground Sea is an Island Swamp,
# so beside it the Encampment enters untapped and taps for {W}. (Positive control for
# dalkovan-encampment-enters-tapped-without-a-swamp-or-a-mountain.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Underground Sea
Plains
Dalkovan Encampment
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Underground Sea.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Dalkovan Encampment.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Dalkovan Encampment.Activate(Ability: {T}: Add {W})
? Bot1.Mana = {W}
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dalkovan Encampment.Tapped = true
